        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTuoluo_L002",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTuoluo_L003",
      "original_quote": "與貪狼同度因酒色以成癆，與火鈴同處，疥疫不死。居疾厄，暗疾纏綿。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
